Third-Party Modified Version of the Fraunhofer FDK AAC Codec Library for Android

This is a modified version of the FDK AAC library (https://github.com/mstorsjo/fdk-aac, branch
master), maintained at https://github.com/nat3Github/cpp-lib-fdk-aac (branch zig), where its complete
source is available free of charge. Changes to upstream, as required by section 2 of NOTICE:

  2026-09-29  added build.zig, build.zig.zon (build with the Zig build system); .gitignore
  2026-09-30  libFDK/src/FDK_qmf_domain.cpp: fail QMF domain configure when a work buffer
              allocation fails
  2026-09-30  added this file
  2026-10-26  libAACenc/src/aacenc_lib.cpp: ADTS with 6.1 / 7.1 (channel configurations 11,
              12, 14) signals configuration 0 and a PCE in every frame; the 3-bit ADTS field
              carried the configuration truncated

